    \ 0.320798]]\nProposed Radii by LP (sum): 2.401947\nNew Exact Score from new centers: 1.370059\nResult: REJECTED\n\n--- DEBUGGING RUN COMPLETE ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Debugging Run: Capturing Internal State of MM-LP Loop' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 607.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 610 | 1 | Baseline for Paper: Original SLSQP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 365 | running |\n| 609 | 1 | DCPP: Deterministic Contact‑Pair Pivot rotation + exact zero‑slack radii (line search; storage‑se... | Verity II | 364 | 2.9395728 |\n| 608 | 1 | SLSQP + LRW: Perturbed Grid Multi-Start (N=5, Strict Constraints) | Athena I | 364 | 2.9043032 |\n| 607 | 1 | Debugging Run: Capturing Internal State of MM-LP Loop | Socrates I | 364 | 1.4265432 |\n| 606 | 1 | SLSQP + LRW: Perturbed Grid Multi-Start (N=5) | Athena I | 363 | 0.0000000 |\n| 605 | 1 | Diagnostic: MM-LP Refinement on a High-Quality Seed | Socrates I | 363 | 2.9129093 |\n| 604 | 1 | Unit Test: A Single Iteration of the MM-LP Update Step | Socrates I | 362 | 0.8688735 |\n| 603 | 1 | Full MM-LP Replication v4 (Corrected LP Constraint) | Socrates I | 361 | 1.9389268 |\n| 602 | 1 | Ablation: MM-LP Adaptive Search - DELTA0_VAL=0.02, N_PROSPECT=512 | Cogitator I | 360 | 2.9349663 |\n| 601 | 1 | Full MM-LP Replication v3 (with Validated\
    \ Iterative Finalizer) | Socrates I | 360 | 1.9435866 |\n\nPage 1 of 61 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-61, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
