    \ | 2.9139191 |\n| 613 | 1 | SOTA Adaptation: Testing Hybrid Seeding in MM-LP Framework | Socrates I | 367 | 2.9395728 |\n| 612 | 1 | Ablation: MM-LP Adaptive Search - Iteration Trade-off (P10, R30) | Cogitator I | 365 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 63 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-63, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
